project_details:
The student will also collaborate with undergraduate and other graduate students in the lab, the postdoctoral researcher, and project collaborators (Columbia Uni, Boston Uni, Tuft Uni, Uni of Sussex/Bath). Interested students should send a single PDF containing:


a brief statement of interest describing research interests, relevant experience, and career goals;
a CV;
unofficial transcripts; and
contact information for two or three references
